# Homunculus Context-Window Egress Firewall (.geminiignore)
# Governed by: 1. Accuracy & Truth -> 2. Efficiency -> 3. Data Safety -> 4. Speed
# Prevents Antigravity / Gemini CLI from indexing local credentials, keys, or personal voice corpora.

.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.template
!.env.sample
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.keystore
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
id_ecdsa*
id_dsa*
!*.pub
client_secret*.json
token*.json
credentials.json
DevToolsActivePort
**/corpus_inbox/*
!**/corpus_inbox/README.md
!**/corpus_inbox/.gitkeep
**/study_briefs/*
!**/study_briefs/README.md
!**/study_briefs/.gitkeep
**/scratch/sandbox_runs/**
